# INVWINX.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the order named
# in the frame's title.  Record > Next order (ALT-C R) goes through the
# orders ID, LOC, MFR and SERIAL and round, the title naming each; the
# item form opened and left in the location order leaves the order and
# the selection as they were.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINX.SNP is its
# snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ID
K ALT-C R
S LOC
K ALT-C R
S MFR
K ALT-C R
S SERIAL
K ALT-C R
S ID2
K ALT-C R DOWN ENTER
S VIEW
K ENTER
S BACK
